<title>AUSTRALIA: Bank Melbourne/Westpac may cut a third of branches.</title>
<headline>Bank Melbourne/Westpac may cut a third of branches.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Melbourne Ltd said on Thursday it and Westpac Banking Corp expected to close up to a third of their branches in Victoria as a result of their planned merger.</p>
<p>Bank of Melbourne Chairman Chris Stewart told reporters the combined branches of Westpac and Bank of Melbourne would fall to &quot;in the 200s&quot; from their current total of 350.</p>
<p>Currently, Westpac has 232 branches in Victoria, while Bank of Melbourne has 126.</p>
</text>
